WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:18.171
was so scared he couldn't move.

2
00:00:19.651 --> 00:00:22.812
Suddenly he felt a strong wind by his ear.

3
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.474
An arrow flew by.

4
00:00:25.494 --> 00:00:31.316
One of the hyenas let out a cry, and the animals ran away.

5
00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:35.750
"Vinnie!" Mandy ran to her brother.

6
00:00:35.771 --> 00:00:38.693
"I'm okay," said Vinnie.

7
00:00:38.713 --> 00:00:44.998
"But who He stopped and stared at a young man holding a bow and arrow.

8
00:00:46.319 --> 00:00:49.402
He also wore an animal skin tied at his waist.

9
00:00:50.623 --> 00:00:53.826
He had six scars on his chest on his right side.

10
00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:58.269
The man stared at the children for a long time.

11
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.432
Then he said, "Where do you come from?"

12
00:01:02.948 --> 00:01:06.110
"Our home is far away," replied Mandy.

13
00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:08.812
"We're on a journey."

14
00:01:10.553 --> 00:01:12.334
The man stared a bit longer.

15
00:01:13.415 --> 00:01:14.656
He seemed curious.

16
00:01:14.676 --> 00:01:17.218
"How long will your journey be?"

17
00:01:17.638 --> 00:01:18.198
he asked.

18
00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.561
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

19
00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:25.703
"We don't know," they answered.

20
00:01:27.464 --> 00:01:28.985
The man motioned to them.

21
00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:32.488
"Let us go to the village," he said.

22
00:01:33.824 --> 00:01:34.864
"You will be safe there."

23
00:01:35.384 --> 00:01:36.265
He walked away.

24
00:01:37.665 --> 00:01:39.166
Mandy looked at her brother.

25
00:01:39.186 --> 00:01:41.726
"What do we do?"

26
00:01:42.527 --> 00:01:43.107
she said.

27
00:01:43.127 --> 00:01:47.388
"Let's follow him," replied Vinnie.

28
00:01:47.408 --> 00:01:49.709
"I don't think he'll hurt us.

29
00:01:50.989 --> 00:01:53.950
After all, he saved me from those scary wolves."

30
00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:57.951
"They were hyenas," said Mandy.

31
00:01:59.411 --> 00:02:01.372
The children ran after the man.

32
00:02:02.948 --> 00:02:05.870
"Excuse me," said Vinnie, "where are we?"

33
00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:11.174
"This is the Kalahari Desert, home of my people," he replied.

34
00:02:11.194 --> 00:02:14.456
"Who are your people?"

35
00:02:15.217 --> 00:02:15.937
asked Mandy.

36
00:02:15.957 --> 00:02:19.500
"We are the Ju/'hoansi," he said.

37
00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.481
"I am Kashe.

38
00:02:22.022 --> 00:02:22.882
What are your names?"

39
00:02:24.183 --> 00:02:26.285
The children introduced themselves.

40
00:02:27.986 --> 00:02:30.468
Kashe stopped in front of an open area.

41
00:02:31.592 --> 00:02:36.013
"Welcome to our village," he said, pointing to ten small huts.

42
00:02:37.314 --> 00:02:39.554
The huts were made out of sticks and grass.

43
00:02:39.574 --> 00:02:43.576
"Kashe!" a woman called out.

44
00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:48.877
"You went hunting for food, but you bring us children."

45
00:02:50.337 --> 00:02:52.798
The villagers all stopped what they were doing.

46
00:02:54.099 --> 00:02:55.559
They surrounded the children.

47
00:02:56.839 --> 00:03:00.072
The men were dressed like Kashe.

48
00:03:00.092 --> 00:03:02.373
The women also wore animal skins.

49
00:03:03.793 --> 00:03:06.234
Most of them had jewelry around their necks.

50
00:03:07.394 --> 00:03:10.235
Some wore brightly colored bands around their heads.

51
00:03:11.915 --> 00:03:14.556
Kashe introduced the children to everyone.

52
00:03:15.636 --> 00:03:17.377
Then the crowd wandered away.

53
00:03:18.777 --> 00:03:21.118
But one curious young girl remained.

54
00:03:22.398 --> 00:03:24.819
"Twi!" a woman called to the girl.

55
00:03:24.839 --> 00:03:27.039
"We have work to do."

56
00:03:27.059 --> 00:03:31.169
"Yes, Mama," Twi called back.

57
00:03:32.329 --> 00:03:33.650
Then she turned to Mandy.

58
00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:36.151
"Will you come with us?"

59
00:03:36.712 --> 00:03:37.272
she asked.

60
00:03:38.713 --> 00:03:40.714
"Where?" said Mandy.

61
00:03:40.734 --> 00:03:45.317
"To gather mongongo nuts," said Twi.

62
00:03:46.717 --> 00:03:48.598
She looked up at the bright sun.

63
00:03:48.618 --> 00:03:51.740
"We should have left a while ago.

64
00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.542
I can tell it will be hot today."

65
00:03:54.562 --> 00:03:57.063
"But it's hot already!"

66
00:03:57.603 --> 00:03:58.364
cried Mandy.

67
00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.381
Twi laughed.

68
00:04:00.401 --> 00:04:02.643
"This is not hot.

69
00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:05.105
It is still early in the day."

70
00:04:06.966 --> 00:04:08.547
Mandy wiped her forehead.

71
00:04:08.567 --> 00:04:11.690
"It's going to get hotter?"

72
00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:12.891
she thought.

73
00:04:12.911 --> 00:04:16.414
"Come with me, Vinnie," Kashe said.

74
00:04:16.434 --> 00:04:19.076
"Where are we going?"

75
00:04:19.596 --> 00:04:20.257
asked Vinnie.

76
00:04:21.398 --> 00:04:23.079
Kashe gave Vinnie a bow.

77
00:04:23.099 --> 00:04:26.942
"We must return to the hunt," he replied.

78
00:04:26.962 --> 00:04:29.338
"Cool!" yelled
